<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA to WATC's 40 bln yen samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA to WATC's 40 bln yen samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Thursday that it had assigned an AA rating to Western Australian Treasury Corp's (WATC) 40 billion yen 5.2 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bond due May 13, 1999.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said that the outlook for the rating was positive.</p>
</text>
